window.__T__=[{"i":4680,"text":"Design Style:\nName: \"Neo Museum\"\n\nConcept: >\n現代美術館の展示ビジュアル、\nデザインカンファレンス、\nテクノロジーアート、\nプレミアムブランドの\nエディトリアルデザインから着想を得た\nミニマルアートプレゼンテーション。\n\nクラシカルな彫刻と\n現代的なグラデーションUIを融合し、\n知性と未来感を両立する。\n\nCanvas:\nRatio: \"16:9\"\n\nMood:\n- Contemporary\n- Premium\n- Minimal\n- Intelligent\n- Editorial\n- Artistic\n- Futuristic\n- Elegant\n\nColor Palette:\n\nBackground:\nPrimary: \"#F2F2F2\"\n\nText:\nPrimary: \"#121212\"\nSecondary: \"#4F4F4F\"\n\nAccent:\nBlue: \"#3D8BFF\"\nGreen: \"#4CAF50\"\nYellow: \"#F7C443\"\nPink: \"#FF7DAF\"\nRed: \"#FF5A4A\"\n\nIllustration:\n\nStyle:\nContemporary Art Editorial\n\nSubjects:\n- Classical sculpture\n- Museum objects\n- Monochrome portraits\n- Abstract geometric shapes\n- Contemporary art imagery\n\nRendering:\nBlack and white photography\nHigh contrast\nFine grain texture\nEditorial composition\n\nTypography:\n\nHeadings:\nStyle: Geometric Sans\nWeight: 600\n\nBody:\nStyle: Modern Sans\nWeight: 400\n\nLayout:\n\nStructure:\n- Large asymmetrical composition\n- Strong visual hierarchy\n- Museum poster layout\n- Wide whitespace\n\nComponents:\n\nCover:\n- Hero sculpture image\n- Large editorial title\n\nSection Divider:\n- Minimal section number\n- Abstract graphic accents\n\nContent:\n- Card-based information blocks\n- Editorial image placement\n- Large statistics\n\nClosing:\n- Full visual statement slide\n\nGraphics:\n\nElements:\n- Gradient bars\n- Soft glow effects\n- Abstract stars\n- Dotted patterns\n- Circular outlines\n- Geometric frames\n\nEffects:\n\nGlow:\nSoft RGB bloom\n\nGradients:\nMulti-color spectrum\n\nTexture:\nVery subtle grain\n\nRules:\n- Use monochrome imagery\n- Add vibrant gradient accents\n- Maintain museum-quality aesthetics\n- Prioritize whitespace\n- Avoid decorative clutter\n- Use large editorial typography\n- Keep layouts asymmetrical\n- Balance art and business readability","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29965_out.png"]},{"i":4681,"text":"复古杂志印刷近景双人\n\n极简时尚封面感，editorial 人像，整体风格融合了半写实动漫美学与 UE5 的超写实渲染，独立艺术企划主视觉。双人近景构图，原神的甘雨和琴，脸部占比大，表情冷漠、轻蔑、带高傲凝视。画风为复古时尚杂志印刷插画，带轻微纸张质感与海报感。构图为紧凑半身特写，一人前景大面积遮挡，一人后方局部露出，人物互相重叠，形成强烈封面压迫感。背景极简，加入不规则的几何形状和线条。画面干净清晰，线条稳定，脸部清楚，整体细节稳定。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29954_out.png"]},{"i":4682,"text":"{\n\"style_name\": \"Loose Scribble Riso Print Style\",\n\"style_slug\": \"loose-scribble-riso-print-style\",\n\"style_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n\"style_summary\": \"A sparse handmade riso or screenprint poster style with one large simplified subject, wavering black contour drawing, rough off-white paper, flat blue and coral-red overprint accents, handwritten margin text, and visible print grain.\",\n\"environment_variables\": {\n\"SUBJECT\": \"The new main subject or simplified object for the print.\",\n\"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"The simple pose, placement, or action of the subject.\",\n\"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"A small supporting prop or object detail that is not the original source prop.\",\n\"LOCATION\": \"A minimal setting or surface that grounds the subject.\",\n\"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"Sparse background details such as a border, ground line, paper speckles, or one small accent mark.\",\n\"MAIN_TEXT\": \"A short handmade phrase to place near the margin.\",\n\"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"Tiny supporting handwritten text or edition-like microcopy that does not mimic the source identity marks.\",\n\"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"One small decorative mark, scribble, star, arrow, dot, or stamp-like accent.\",\n\"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"Styling direction for any character or object treatment, kept flat and handmade.\",\n\"STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS\": \"Observable style traits that must remain visible in the generated sample.\",\n\"SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID\": \"Literal source content that generated samples must not recreate.\",\n\"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"9:16 or 16:9\"\n},","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29902_out.png"]},{"i":4683,"text":"Create an illustration of the girl standing full body at eye level, exhaling a visible puff of cold breath, holding a freshly drawn omikuji fortune paper in one hand and reading it with a small hopeful frown, the other hand tucked inside the sleeve of a deep plum kimono with a pale gold obi, worn over a white knit turtleneck peeking at the collar because she's the kind of person who layers practical under traditional. White tabi and wooden geta. A small bell charm from the shrine dangles from her wrist. Her bob is pinned back on one side with a simple kanzashi. Caption: 「小吉。…まあ、悪くない。」 (\"Minor blessing... well, not bad.\")The girl is the same person in every image: she has a short messy dark bob that hits just below her jawline with a slight natural wave, dark brown eyes, a small beauty mark under her left eye, light freckles across her nose, a slim build, and an effortlessly slightly-disheveled quality to everything she wears. She is in her early twenties. Her expression changes with each month but her face is always recognizably the same girl. Clean, modern anime-style fashion illustration with crisp confident linework, soft flat cel shading with subtle gradients, semi-realistic proportions, and a pure white background with no scenery — only the figure, generous negative space, and a single short vertical Japanese caption in casual handwritten-style font. Tall portrait format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29746_out.png"]},{"i":4684,"text":"鸣潮，清宵，创建一张动漫角色的“自我镜像海报”。 设计结构：上方人物俯冲压近，下方人物仰视承接，双手形成视觉框，脸部距离制造情绪张力。 把第二个人物设计成“另一个自己”：倒影、残影、灵魂面。这样画面就不只是双人互动，而是角色和自我命运的对视。 关键词：双生镜像、上压下构图、近距离对视、手臂框景、元素粒子、角色符号、电影级逆光、高细节二次元海报。整体画面干净清晰，主体识别度高，脸部清楚，表情明确，手部结构自然准确，手指数量正确，比例正常，关节清晰，姿态合理，粒子特效克制\"","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29680_out.png"]},{"i":4685,"text":"Create a character sheet on Renoise using GPT Image 2\n\nHere's the \n\nprofessional anime character reference sheet,\nbeach sports character bible,\nsurf lifestyle brand mascot design,\nhigh-end anime illustration sheet,\nJapanese character setting collection style,\nvisual development document,\ncommercial character presentation board,\nanime key visual sheet,\nmodern waifu character design,\nsummer sports concept art,\nclean character turnaround sheet,\nultra detailed anime illustration,\npremium game character reference sheet\n\nfemale surfer,\n19 years old,\nJapanese,\nathletic slim body,\nhealthy beach tan skin,\nlong dark brown hair,\nmessy high ponytail,\nbright blue eyes,\nenergetic smile,\nsun-kissed appearance,\nconfident and adventurous personality\n\nCORE DESIGN:\n\nfree-spirited surfer girl,\nocean lover,\nsummer lifestyle icon,\ncompetitive but cheerful,\nalways searching for the perfect wave,\nCalifornia + Japanese coastal aesthetic,\nsporty and feminine balance\n\nOUTFIT:\n\nwhite tropical bikini top,\nlight blue palm tree pattern,\nblack surf shorts,\ndrawstring waist,\nsurf ankle leash,\nocean-themed necklace,\nbracelets,\nsunglasses resting on head,\nbarefoot beach athlete\n\nMAIN DISPLAY:\n\nlarge full body front view,\nlarge full body back view,\nstanding naturally beside surfboard,\nrelaxed confident pose,\nprofessional character showcase\n\nSURFBOARD DESIGN:\n\nwhite shortboard,\nblue accent trim,\ncustom NAMI logo,\npalm tree emblem,\nocean wave graphics,\nsurf brand decals,\nprofessional surf equipment presentation\n\nEXPRESSION SHEET:\n\nhappy smile,\ngentle smile,\nlaughing expression,\nconfident expression,\nsurprised expression,\nfocused surfing expression,\nside profile portrait,\nthree-quarter portrait\n\nOUTFIT DETAILS:\n\nbikini top close-up,\nback tie detail,\nshorts detail,\nsurf leash detail,\nnecklace detail,\nfabric texture detail,\nsportswear construction study\n\nACCESSORIES:\n\nsunglasses,\nnecklace,\nbracelets,\nsurf ankle leash,\nsurf stickers,\nbeach-themed accessories\n\nACTION PANEL:\n\nlarge surfing illustration on right side,\nNami riding a powerful blue ocean wave,\ndynamic water splash,\nsunlight reflections,\nwind-blown hair,\naction pose,\nsummer sky,\ncinematic surfing moment\n\nPROFILE SECTION:\n\ncharacter information block,\nname,\nage,\nbirthday,\nheight,\nnationality,\noccupation,\nfavorite things,\npersonality description,\nstory background section,\nsurf lifestyle notes\n\nCOLOR PALETTE:\n\nocean blue,\nsky blue,\nwhite foam,\ndeep navy,\nbeach beige,\nwarm skin tones,\nsummer sunlight colors,\nclean tropical palette\n\nLAYOUT:\n\nprofessional character sheet layout,\nleft information panel,\ncenter turnaround views,\nupper expression section,\nmiddle outfit detail section,\nbottom accessory section,\nlarge surfing key visual on right,\nclean white background,\neditorial graphic design,\nanime artbook presentation,\nofficial character encyclopedia style\n\nVISUAL QUALITY:\n\nanime masterpiece,\nbest quality,\nultra detailed,\nprofessional character turnaround sheet,\nofficial artbook design,\ncommercial IP presentation,\nclean linework,\nsoft anime shading,\nvibrant summer atmosphere,\nstudio quality illustration,\n8k,\ncharacter reference sheet,\ngame-ready character design,\nproduction-ready presentation board","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29639_out.png"]},{"i":4686,"text":"Cinematic promotional poster for Porsche Esports Challenge China, a silver Porsche 911 GT3 RS race car captured in explosive high-speed motion on a curved racetrack at night inside a futuristic cyberpunk megacity. Low dynamic three-quarter front angle, widebody kit, massive rear wing, glossy metallic silver paint with black racing stripes and sponsor logos (Porsche on windshield, Mobil 1, Michelin, TAG Heuer). Bright headlights with lens flare, heavy motion blur on spinning wheels and dramatic red-cyan light streaks across the frame. Background features towering neon-lit skyscrapers under a dramatic magenta and deep blue night sky. Huge bold 3D text \"VROOM!!!\" in white with blue and red outline explodes on the right side. Top left: clean white text \"PORSCHE ESPORTS CHALLENGE CHINA\" with red underline + Chinese subtitle \"中国保时捷赛车电竞挑战赛\" below it. Small holographic UI near the car shows \"118km/h\" and \"LAP 2/5\". Ultra-detailed professional 3D automotive render mixed with graphic design, strong neon cyberpunk lighting, high contrast, epic composition, sharp car focus with motion blur on background, 8k","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29620_out.png"]},{"i":4687,"text":"A cinematic vertical racing tribute poster, a Formula One driver in a red vintage racing suit standing heroically on the sidepod of a classic white-and-red race car, one knee raised, helmet visor reflecting golden sunset light, enormous surreal racing helmet floating behind him like a monument, fireworks exploding around the figure, hot air balloons drifting in the distant sky, birds flying near the horizon, dusty racetrack foreground, dramatic low-angle composition, strong warm backlight, lens flare, orange sunset sky, vintage motorsport nostalgia, hyper-detailed sponsor-style decals, glossy helmet reflections, smoky atmosphere, epic Netflix-style sports documentary poster, bold large title text at the bottom reading “SENNA”, cinematic color grading, realistic digital painting, ultra detailed, sharp focus, 4:5 poster composition","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29560_out.png"]},{"i":4688,"text":"Design a minimal early-internet personal profile webpage / digital portfolio landing page on a large white canvas with generous negative space and a thin pastel pink browser-style frame. In the center, place a black-and-white editorial portrait of [SUBJECT], featuring soft film grain, subtle scanner texture, and low-contrast photographic tones.\n\nSurround the portrait with scattered profile metadata labels and small star-bullet elements arranged asymmetrically, resembling a playful personal résumé. Include descriptors such as:\n\n✦ creator\n✦ model\n✦ stylist\n✦ DJ\n✦ girl\n✦ photographer\n✦ collector\n✦ dreamer\n\nIn the top-left corner, create a colorful hand-drawn logo or personal brand mark. Beneath it, add a tiny timestamp and date in a small system font, mimicking an old personal homepage.\n\nIn the top-right corner, place irregular sticker-like navigation tabs in bright accent colors (pink, cyan, purple, yellow, and green). Use simple labels such as:\n\nHOME\nABOUT\nWORK\nDIARY\nLINKS\n\nScatter handwritten marker-style notes, introductions, personal thoughts, and lifestyle captions throughout the empty space. Examples:\n\n\"currently making things online\"\n\"welcome to my homepage\"\n\"music, fashion, internet\"\n\"updated today\"\n\"living between projects\"\n\nMaintain an anti-grid editorial layout with intentionally imperfect spacing and playful placement. Mix tiny system fonts, handwritten script, and casual notebook-style annotations. Keep the portrait entirely monochrome while reserving color only for the logo, navigation stickers, and a few small graphic accents.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29559_out.png"]},{"i":4689,"text":"A cute young East Asian woman in her early 20s with fair skin and short black bob, lying down in bright sunlight, playfully winking at the camera.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29557_out.png"]},{"i":4690,"text":"a young woman enjoying warm sunlight at home, playfully trying on a cute lace accessory and capturing a lighthearted self-portrait","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29555_out.png"]},{"i":4691,"text":"{\n\"style_name\": \"Neon Type Photo Scribble Poster\",\n\"style_slug\": \"neon-type-photo-scribble-poster\",\n\"style_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n\"style_summary\": \"A high-impact event poster system built from a toxic neon color field, huge black condensed typography, a centered documentary photo crop, and a raw white spray-marker gesture that cuts across the middle of the composition.\",\n\"environment_variables\": {\n\"SUBJECT\": \"main subject\",\n\"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"main action\",\n\"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"object, product, or prop\",\n\"LOCATION\": \"environment or setting\",\n\"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"secondary scene details\",\n\"MAIN_TEXT\": \"main headline or graphic text\",\n\"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"small supporting text\",\n\"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"separator or decorative symbol\",\n\"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"styling direction\",\n\"STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS\": \"observable style traits that must remain visible\",\n\"SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID\": \"literal source content that generated samples must not recreate\",\n\"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"9:16 or 16:9\"\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29549_out.png"]},{"i":4692,"text":"Vertical magazine cover, in the official League of Legends art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed.\n\nThe central character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [character visual description, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and temperament].\n\nShe stands in a pose that matches her personality, striking a stylish pose. Dynamic perspective.\n\nOutfit: [a magazine-style elegant version adapted from the character’s classic outfit].\n\nBackground: clean light-gray background with subtle geometric patterns, with a strong diagonal shadow cast from the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout, with precise text placement, keeping everything exactly as follows:\n\nTop-left red stylized logo\nLarge semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\nTop-right Promptsref brand mark\nGold star badge on the left\nElegant text box on the left, containing large gold serif [CHARACTER_NAME] text + “INTERVIEW” label\nRight side text: “2026 Year.”\nBottom-right red and white welcome box: “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU”\nBottom-left barcode + “ASTRA” text\nBlack horizontal bar at the bottom\n\nThe composition, lighting, shadows, and typography style are exactly consistent with a League of Legends magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is Annie","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29545_out.png"]},{"i":4693,"text":"Vertical magazine cover, in the official League of Legends art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed.\n\nThe central character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [character visual description, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and temperament].\n\nShe stands in a pose that matches her personality, striking a stylish pose. Dynamic perspective.\n\nOutfit: [a magazine-style elegant version adapted from the character’s classic outfit].\n\nBackground: clean light-gray background with subtle geometric patterns, with a strong diagonal shadow cast from the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout, with precise text placement, keeping everything exactly as follows:\n\nTop-left red stylized logo\nLarge semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\nTop-right Promptsref brand mark\nGold star badge on the left\nElegant text box on the left, containing large gold serif [CHARACTER_NAME] text + “INTERVIEW” label\nRight side text: “2026 Year.”\nBottom-right red and white welcome box: “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU”\nBottom-left barcode + “ASTRA” text\nBlack horizontal bar at the bottom\n\nThe composition, lighting, shadows, and typography style are exactly consistent with a League of Legends magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is Diana","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29540_out.png"]},{"i":4694,"text":"Vertical magazine cover, in the official League of Legends art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed.\n\nThe central character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [character visual description, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and temperament].\n\nShe stands in a pose that matches her personality, striking a stylish pose. Dynamic perspective.\n\nOutfit: [a magazine-style elegant version adapted from the character’s classic outfit].\n\nBackground: clean light-gray background with subtle geometric patterns, with a strong diagonal shadow cast from the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout, with precise text placement, keeping everything exactly as follows:\n\nTop-left red stylized logo\nLarge semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\nTop-right Promptsref brand mark\nGold star badge on the left\nElegant text box on the left, containing large gold serif [CHARACTER_NAME] text + “INTERVIEW” label\nRight side text: “2026 Year.”\nBottom-right red and white welcome box: “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU”\nBottom-left barcode + “ASTRA” text\nBlack horizontal bar at the bottom\n\nThe composition, lighting, shadows, and typography style are exactly consistent with a League of Legends magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is Ahri","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29535_out.png"]},{"i":4695,"text":"Vertical magazine cover, in the official League of Legends art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed.\n\nThe central character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [character visual description, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and temperament].\n\nShe stands in a pose that matches her personality, striking a stylish pose. Dynamic perspective.\n\nOutfit: [a magazine-style elegant version adapted from the character’s classic outfit].\n\nBackground: clean light-gray background with subtle geometric patterns, with a strong diagonal shadow cast from the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout, with precise text placement, keeping everything exactly as follows:\n\nTop-left red stylized logo\nLarge semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\nTop-right Promptsref brand mark\nGold star badge on the left\nElegant text box on the left, containing large gold serif [CHARACTER_NAME] text + “INTERVIEW” label\nRight side text: “2026 Year.”\nBottom-right red and white welcome box: “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU”\nBottom-left barcode + “ASTRA” text\nBlack horizontal bar at the bottom\n\nThe composition, lighting, shadows, and typography style are exactly consistent with a League of Legends magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is jinx","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29529_out.png"]},{"i":4696,"text":"Vertical magazine cover in exact Zenless Zone Zero official art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed.\n\nCentral character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [Detailed visual description of the character, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and aura]. She stands in a confident full-body dynamic pose that fits her personality, striking a dynamic and charismatic pose. Strong, elegant, and charismatic presence.\n\nOutfit: [Stylized high-fashion magazine version of her signature outfit, for example: tight white sleeveless crop top with black suspenders, black short pleated mini skirt, black gloves, black heeled boots. Maintain strong character recognition while elevating the fashion sense].\n\nBackground: clean light gray with subtle geometric patterns, strong diagonal shadow cast to the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout with precise text placement (keep exactly as is):\n- Top left red stylized logo\n- Large semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\n- Top right Promptsref branding\n- Left gold star badge\n- Left elegant text box with large gold [CHARACTER_NAME] in serif font + Vietnamese interview text below + “INTERVIEW” label\n- Right side “2026 Year.”\n- Bottom right red/white welcome box “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU” + Vietnamese text\n- Bottom left barcode + “ASTRA” text\n- Bottom black bar\n\nExact same composition, lighting, shadow, and typography style as a professional Zenless Zone Zero magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is Tifa Lockhart","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29528_out.png"]},{"i":4697,"text":"Vertical magazine cover in exact Zenless Zone Zero official art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition, masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed.\n\nCentral character is [CHARACTER_NAME]: [Detailed visual description of the character, including age, overall appearance, hair, eyes, expression, body type, and aura]. She stands in a confident full-body dynamic pose that fits her personality, weight shifted to one leg, body slightly angled toward the viewer, head gently tilted, striking a dynamic and charismatic pose. Strong, elegant, and charismatic presence.\n\nOutfit: [Stylized high-fashion magazine version of her signature outfit, for example: tight white sleeveless crop top with black suspenders, black short pleated mini skirt, black gloves, black heeled boots. Maintain strong character recognition while elevating the fashion sense].\n\nBackground: clean light gray with subtle geometric patterns, strong diagonal shadow cast to the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout with precise text placement (keep exactly as is):\n- Top left red stylized logo\n- Large semi-transparent bold red title behind the character\n- Top right Promptsref branding\n- Left gold star badge\n- Left elegant text box with large gold [CHARACTER_NAME] in serif font + Vietnamese interview text below + “INTERVIEW” label\n- Right side “2026 Year.”\n- Bottom right red/white welcome box “WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU” + Vietnamese text\n- Bottom left barcode + “ASTRA” text\n- Bottom black bar\n\nExact same composition, lighting, shadow, and typography style as a professional Zenless Zone Zero magazine cover. Sharp focus, cinematic lighting, 8k.\n\nThe character is chunli","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29526_out.png"]},{"i":4698,"text":"Vertical magazine cover in exact Zenless Zone Zero official art style, highly detailed anime illustration, vibrant colors, glossy rendering, professional character design, dynamic composition. \n\nCentral character is Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII: beautiful young woman, long voluminous black hair flowing dramatically to the right with motion, straight bangs, warm brown eyes, gentle confident smile, fair skin, athletic and curvaceous figure with large bust and long legs. \n\nShe stands in a confident three-quarter pose, body slightly turned, one leg forward, holding a long ornate golden staff with large circular gold frame and blue central gem on top, twisted wooden shaft, sharp blade at the bottom. Left hand extended gracefully. \n\nOutfit: tight black corset top with gold circular cutouts and gold trim, white off-shoulder long-sleeve blouse with black ribbon ties and pearl details underneath, short black ruffled mini skirt with white scalloped lace hem and multiple black bows, white petticoat peeking out, blue beaded thigh garter on right thigh, black glossy high-heel shoes with large black ribbon bows. White headband, gold star earrings, pearl accessories.\n\nBackground: clean light gray with subtle geometric patterns, strong diagonal shadow cast to the lower right.\n\nMagazine cover layout with precise text placement:\n- Top left: red stylized \"CHARMER\" logo\n- Large semi-transparent bold red \"LIFER\" title behind the character\n- Top right: \"ZENLESS\" logo and \"+ ÁNH ĐÈN PHA LỆ +\"\n- Left middle: gold star badge \"PART 03 New Bride\"\n- Left side: elegant white text box with large gold \"TIFA\" in serif font, Vietnamese interview text below, \"INTERVIEW\" label\n- Right side: large \"2025 Year.\" with flame icon and Vietnamese descriptive paragraph\n- Bottom right: red and white box \"WELCOME TO NEW ERIDU\", \"TRANG PHỤC CÙNG KIỂU\", \"[ SẮP LÊN KỆ TRONG ]\", \"CỦA HÀNG NEW ERIDU!\"\n- Bottom left: barcode next to \"ASTRA\" and Vietnamese text \"Ra mắt hoành tráng Giản dị bắt mắt\"\n- Bottom black bar: \"05 Z.Z.Z. NGƯỜI DÂN NEW ERIDU JAN. 2025\"\n\nExact same composition, lighting, shadow, color grading and typography style as the reference magazine cover. Masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed, sharp focus, 8k --stylize 250 --v 6","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29518_out.png"]},{"i":4699,"text":"作为 \n@Image1=萨勒芬妮\n绝对的主要参考资料。制作一幅 16：9 水平宽屏风格化插画，展示一张新的最终图像，基于\n@Image1\n背景简洁但带有梦幻效果，好像是公平且不合反应。图片 1 是黑白，只有一个颜色点缀。考虑是否有点缀色，或者用眼睛颜色作为点缀色。Image1 举着一副形状杂乱的眼镜，遮住了脸的下半部分，你仍然能透过玻璃看到他们的面部特征。随意挑选是左手还是右手举杯。如果图片 1 有尾巴，那也合理且有道理，尾巴也可以是支撑玻璃的那个。玻璃本身里面的液体含量是随机的，有时刚满到溢出来。液体内部有一个随机场景，对图片 1 来说是合理的，参考参考表中可能存在的主题。让 image1 摆在随机位置、姿势和摄像机角度，确保是 image1 的脸部特写和手中的玻璃杯。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29465_out.png"]},{"i":4700,"text":"A massive brutalist concrete building with stacked geometric balconies, raw gray concrete texture, deep rectangular windows glowing orange, saturated orange sky, hard sunlight and sharp shadows, architectural photography with bold graphic contrast.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29222_out.png"]},{"i":4701,"text":"[Main Roles] the most recognizable head, face outline, mask or outer outline of the figure is the large visual subject, forming a highly recognizable silhouette main shape; the middle and lower part is arranged with the complete figure as the second subject, showing a stable standing or slight movement posture, forming the visual core of the picture.Double exposure and collage narrative compositions inside and around the large outline, combining multiple scenes, images, small character relationships, auxiliary elements and environmental layers in clouds, ink, and whitening. The left and right side is equipped with an echoing side of the scene, which creates story tension and space changes. Link the main character, internal collage, and large outline above with a flow of clues across the screen to enhance integrity and vision guidance.The overall picture retains a large area of whiteness, and the edge is stained with ink and virtual broken, creating a real relationship and breath in the Oriental aesthetics. Overall style uniform, advanced and restrained, emphasizing layers, narrative, main visual impact and serialized poster language. Size: 9:16.\n\nShow more","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/29167_out.png"]},{"i":4702,"text":"围绕用户提供的照片生成一张电影海报式的人像作品，核心是用巨大的纯净色场托起依偎在画面边缘、各自仰望天空的主体。整张画面约四分之三是一整片干净、饱和、毫无杂物的单色场，像被无限拉远的天空，制造开阔、想念、夏日般的留白呼吸感；主体只占据画面一侧约四分之一的窄带，把绝大部分空间让给空旷的色场。构图随画幅自适应：竖幅时主体贴着画面底部成一道低矮的横排，天空向上延展；横幅时主体贴着画面一侧（如左侧）成一道竖排，空旷色场向另一侧（如右侧）大幅铺开，文字落在那片空场里；无论横竖，主体与文字始终分居两端，留白占主导。镜头必须是从下方仰拍的极低角度（虫视角）：每个角色的头都向后仰、下巴抬高、喉颈舒展，脸朝向头顶那片空旷的色场向上凝望，观者主要看到的是下颌底缘与侧脸或四分之三侧脸的轮廓——角色绝不正对镜头、绝不与镜头平视对视、不做正面证件式人像、视线不落在观者身上而是投向头顶的天空。只露出头部、肩部与少量上身，下缘被画面边缘自然裁切。\n\n主体对象不作任何种类限定，一切以输入照片里真实出现的对象为准；其身份、数量、种类与组合必须严格忠实于原照片、一一对应，不得凭空增殖、复制、繁殖或添加画面之外多余的对象。关键的依偎姿态是相互倚靠而非朝同一处看：各对象背靠背、头靠头，或一方把后脑、头侧倚在另一方的肩颈上，彼此朝相反或不同的方向偏靠依偎，每个对象各自把头仰向自己那一侧的天空，目光发散投向不同方向的空旷色场，而不是汇聚在同一焦点；每个对象都保持下巴抬高、向上仰望的姿态，整体传达依偎、亲密又各自出神的情绪。除非用户明确要求重复或镜像，否则不要把同一张脸或同一个对象复制成多个。\n\n在远离主体的那片空场里放置手写、带笔触飞白与轻微连笔的标题文字，字形随性、略带斜势与手绘趣味，分成两到三行错落排布，使用与主色场形成温暖对比的明亮强调色（明黄气质，可依主题情绪微调色相），让这组字像漂浮在空中的私人签名。标题文字内容默认为手写英文 “Call Me By Your Name”，仅当用户提供自定义文字时才替换为用户指定的内容。标题位置随画幅自适应：竖幅时落在上方空场的中部偏上，横幅时落在主体对侧那片大留白的中央。标题上方放一行更小的细体说明性文字（默认 “a film by …” 风格），标题下方放两到三行更小的强调色或白色大写信息行（默认 “IN SELECT THEATERS / NOVEMBER 24 / #CMBYN” 这类影院上映与标签式短句，用户可自定义）；竖幅版另可在最顶部居中堆叠数行极小的白色影评引语式短句，并在底部贴边压一行白色大写主演名与一整块细密低调的小字版权信息条，构成完整的电影海报文字秩序。\n\n主色场默认采用原作那种纯净、饱和、略深的钴蓝／天青色——晴朗夏日正午天空般的蓝，近似 #0A66AC（红极低、绿居中、蓝偏高），明确偏蓝而不偏青、不发灰、不偏紫、不偏粉蓝、也不偏藏青或墨蓝；仅当用户指定其它主题色时才整体替换，替换后仍须保留同样的纯净、饱和与高明度关系。整体色彩角色为：单一大面积纯净高明度色场占主导、一处温暖手写强调色（默认明黄）作点睛、白色文字承担信息、人物保留真实自然肤色与衣物色。画面明亮、通透、干净、饱和而不脏，带开阔与思念的温柔气息；即便选用更深的色场也要保持光感清澈、色阶清晰、留白透气，避免发灰、发旧、发闷、蒙脏或做旧。视觉权重牢牢集中在巨大空场与边缘仰望主体的对比上，主体绝不可放大占满画面、绝不可正面平拍、绝不可失去大片留白与上仰发散的视线。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28783_out.png"]},{"i":4703,"text":"Use the attached reference photo only for identity reference. Create an ultra-realistic collectible Mega games store photography scene featuring the exact person from the reference image cosplaying as Boa Hancock from One Piece.\n\nIMPORTANT: Preserve the person’s exact facial identity, facial structure, eyes, nose, lips, jawline, skin tone, and overall recognizable appearance. The person must remain instantly recognizable as the same individual from the reference photo. Adapt the hairstyle to match Boa Hancock’s long, flowing black hair with signature snake motif and golden snake ornament while keeping the face 100% identical to the reference.\n\nThe person is dressed in a high-quality, accurate cosplay of Boa Hancock: signature red cheongsam-style dress with gold trim and dramatic high side slit, snake-themed accessories and jewelry, elegant yet seductive presentation that perfectly suits the character’s personality and the reference person’s appearance.\n\nThe person is standing inside a large, authentic collectible game store during daytime. The store is filled with shelves displaying hundreds of collectible PVC figures, PS5 consoles, Xbox, controllers, DVDs, designer toys, anime figures, character statues, and premium collectibles. Many figures with similar proportions and styles are visible throughout the background, creating the feeling of a specialty figure shop and collector’s paradise. The environment feels authentic, busy, and visually rich, with rows of display cases, toy boxes, figurines, and colorful merchandise.\n\nSeveral identical “KOKIE” figurines can be seen displayed on shelves behind the person, including versions resembling popular characters like Hancock, as if the character has become a popular collectible toy line.\n\nThe person is holding a highly detailed collectible PVC figurine of themselves as Boa Hancock. The figurine is approximately 50 cm tall and is held naturally in both hands. The figurine depicts the same person in the exact same Hancock cosplay outfit, hairstyle, and identity. The figurine is designed as a premium collectible character figure with a realistic sculpt and high-quality PVC finish, but with humorous 3-head-tall proportion, oversized head, compact body, and intentionally exaggerated proportions. The figurine stands in a confident arms-at-sides heroic stance. A small collectible product tag attached to the figurine clearly reads: “KOKIE”\n\nThe figurine is making an intentionally ridiculous, awkward, exaggerated, ugly-cute facial expression. The expression includes:\n- unnaturally wide eyes\n- uneven eyebrows\n- distorted cheeks\n- awkward mouth shape\n- exaggerated lips\n- strange facial tension\n- asymmetrical facial expression\n- intentionally goofy facial pose\n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT: The real person’s facial expression MUST be identical to the figurine’s facial expression. The real person (in Boa Hancock cosplay) is actively recreating every distorted facial feature shown on the figurine with perfect accuracy. Every facial detail aligns precisely: eyes, eyebrows, mouth shape, cheek position, facial tension, head tilt, and overall facial asymmetry. The figurine should look like a miniature version of the real person brought to life. The viewer should immediately notice that the person is perfectly copying the ridiculous expression from the figurine. If the real person’s expression does not perfectly match the figurine, the image is incorrect. Expression matching is the single highest priority of the entire image. It is more important than beauty, attractiveness, fashion, photographic glamour, or portrait aesthetics.\n\nThe humor comes entirely from the contrast between the realistic high-quality Boa Hancock cosplay and their absurd collectible figure. Cute chaotic energy, wholesome humor, meme-worthy composition, viral social media aesthetic, authentic candid moment.\n\nOverlay handwritten-style doodles and annotations across the image: arrows, hearts, stars, sparkles, icons, and playful captions connected to elements in the scene (especially pointing out the matching ridiculous expressions and the “KOKIE” tag).\n\nAuthentic collectible toy shop atmosphere, figure collector culture, premium hobby store interior, shelves packed with designer toys and PVC figures, realistic retail displays, toy store photography aesthetic.\n\nRealistic skin texture, realistic hands, shallow depth of field, highly detailed face, highly detailed PVC figurine, photorealistic quality. Social-media-viral composition, highly shareable visual storytelling, humorous personality-driven photography, trending meme aesthetic.\n\nBeauty is secondary. Expression accuracy is mandatory. The figurine’s expression should be even more absurd and embarrassing than would normally be acceptable in a professional portrait.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28775_out.png"]},{"i":4704,"text":"{\n\"style_name\": \"Scarlet Shard Photo Type Poster Style\",\n\"style_slug\": \"scarlet-shard-photo-type-poster-style\",\n\"style_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n\"style_summary\": \"A high-energy editorial poster system built from a scarlet grain field, oversized white geometric shards, cropped cyan-tinted photography, and stacked modern sans typography arranged around a central fractured aperture.\",\n\"environment_variables\": {\n\"SUBJECT\": \"main subject\",\n\"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"main action\",\n\"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"object, product, or prop\",\n\"LOCATION\": \"environment or setting\",\n\"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"secondary scene details\",\n\"MAIN_TEXT\": \"main headline or graphic text\",\n\"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"small repeated supporting text\",\n\"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"separator or decorative symbol\",\n\"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"styling direction\",\n\"STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS\": \"observable style traits that must remain visible\",\n\"SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID\": \"literal source content that generated samples must not recreate\",\n\"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"9:16 or 16:9\"\n},","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28738_out.png"]},{"i":4705,"text":"High-impact e-commerce infographic for \"Apple Pods Pro 3\" \npremium wireless over-ear headphones.\n\nFOREGROUND - PRODUCT HERO SHOT\nExtreme close-up of a hand holding a sleek, \nmatte-white premium over-ear headphone toward the camera \nat a slight angle. The headphone features:\n- Glossy white ear cushions with soft memory foam padding\n- Brushed aluminum silver headband with subtle Apple Pods \nPro 3 embossed branding\n- Black mesh speaker grille visible on the ear cup face\n- A tiny glowing green LED status indicator on the \nright ear cup edge\n- Subtle touch-control icons etched on the outer cup surface\n\nMacro-lens shallow depth of field — hand and headphone \nslightly blurred at edges to create cinematic depth. \nProduct remains razor-sharp in center frame.\n\nCENTRAL SUBJECT — MODEL\nIn the mid-ground: a smiling young woman with freckles \nand wavy pastel-pink hair. She wears:\n- A vibrant lime-green knit beanie\n- A psychedelic black and white-striped long-sleeve shirt\n- The white over-ear headphones resting stylishly \naround her neck (not on ears) — one hand casually \ntouching the ear cup\n\nExpression: relaxed, confident, joyful. \nShe is glancing slightly off-camera with a natural smile.\n\nBACKGROUND & ATMOSPHERE\nClean soft-focus studio backdrop — light gray gradient \nfading to warm white at center. \n\nAtmospheric overlays:\n- Diagonal rainbow prism lens flares cutting across \nupper-left to lower-right\n- Soft pastel light leaks in pink and yellow at corners\n- 4–5 blurred white over-ear headphones floating \nartistically in the background at various depths \nand rotation angles\n- Subtle bokeh circles from background studio lights\n\nLighting: Soft professional three-point studio lighting. \nKey light from upper-left, fill light right side. \nRim light behind model for separation. \nGlossy highlights on headphone surfaces catching light naturally.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY & LAYOUT — Sans-Serif, Clean white \nTOP CENTER (behind model, large background text):\n→ Massive bold oversized text: \"HEADPHONES\"\nSemi-transparent white, spanning full width behind subject\n\nTOP RIGHT CORNER:\n→ Bold clean text: \"Apple Pods Pro 3\"\nSubtitle smaller text: \"Over-Ear Wireless\"\n\nMID LEFT:\n→ Icon: small sound wave symbol\n→ Bold text: \"Premium Sound\"\n→ Sub-text: \"Active Noise Cancellation + Transparency Mode\"\n\nMID RIGHT:\n→ Extra-large bold numeral: \"40\"\n→ Smaller text below: \"hours of battery life\"\n\nLOWER LEFT:\n→ Extra-large bold numeral: \"0\"\nwith \"to\" beside it → then bold \"100%\"\n→ Sub-text: \"Fast charge — 10 min = 3hrs playback\"\n\nBOTTOM RIGHT:\n→ Extra-large bold numeral: \"1\"\n→ Sub-text: \"Year Warranty Included\"\n\nBOTTOM CENTER (fine print style):\n→ Small elegant text: \n\"Bluetooth 5.4 | Hi-Res Audio Certified \n| Foldable Design | USB-C Charging\"\n\nTECHNICAL SPECS\nResolution: 8K ultra-sharp\nStyle: Commercial product photography meets \neditorial fashion advertising\nColor Palette: White, lime green, pastel pink, \nrainbow prism accents\nFocus: Tack-sharp on headphone product — \nshallow DOF on everything else\nLens: 85mm macro, slight low angle\nRender Quality: Hyperrealistic, clean ad aesthetic, \nvibrant yet professional color grading","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28736_out.png"]},{"i":4706,"text":"A central subject surrounded by sticker elements that feel cut-out and layered like a scrapbook.\n\nElements slightly overlap with:\n- uneven edges\n- subtle paper texture\n- soft imperfect shadows\n\nArrangement still radial but less rigid.\n\nAdd small tape pieces or torn edges.\n\nMood: handmade, tactile, artistic, playful layering","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28734_out.png"]},{"i":4707,"text":"Create a wide, horizontal character reference sheet featuring Ann from one piece with long hair The background should be white grid paper.\n\nThe page should include multiple angles of the same character:\n\nA front close-up\nA confident standing front pose (one hand on hip)\nA back-facing standing pose\n\n\n\nThe layout should be customized to fit the character’s personality—visually rich yet clean and easy to read. You may include handwritten-style annotations, small arrows, and a prominent title area styled like a character name header.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28716_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28716_in0.png"]},{"i":4708,"text":"Create a vertical 9:16 premium Tokyo Y2K beach campaign poster featuring Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII as an adult reimagined character.\n\nThe central character is a beautiful 25-year-old Japanese-Korean woman with long silky black hair, soft windblown strands, beautiful brown eyes, an elegant mature face, soft glossy lips, and a fit athletic curvy body. She has a confident, slightly seductive summer expression and looks directly at the viewer.\n\nShe is standing on a tropical beach at sunset in a stylish fashion-poster pose. Use a low-angle editorial composition, with her occupying most of the frame. One hand rests near her hip, while the other holds stylish sunglasses or a surfboard strap. A surfboard is placed nearby as a beach campaign prop.\n\nHer outfit is a modern Tifa-inspired luxury summer look: a white fitted crop top, black low-rise bikini bottoms or ultra-short beach shorts, black arm sleeves, fingerless gloves, subtle red accents, a delicate waist chain, and premium glossy swimwear fabric. The outfit should feel sporty, sexy, fashionable, and tasteful.\n\nThe visual style is Tokyo Y2K beach campaign mixed with Japanese hip-hop fashion. Add Harajuku summer styling, glossy chrome design elements, neon pink and cyan accents, retro-futuristic beach graphics, graffiti stickers, star icons, chrome hearts, digital UI details, and bold magazine-style poster typography.\n\nBackground: tropical beach, golden sunset sky, palm trees, ocean waves, beach club atmosphere, soft lens flare, warm sunlight, cinematic rim lighting, glowing highlights on the skin, subtle summer body sheen, detailed skin texture, glossy magazine-quality finish.\n\nMake the final image ultra-detailed, semi-realistic anime-to-realistic, cinematic, sharp, stylish, luxurious, and suitable as a high-end summer fashion advertisement.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28629_out.png"]},{"i":4709,"text":"{\n\"style_name\": \"Sunlit Kinetic Block Type Photo Poster\",\n\"style_slug\": \"sunlit-kinetic-block-type-photo-poster-style\",\n\"style_version\": \"2.1.0\",\n\"style_summary\": \"A high-energy editorial sports and lifestyle poster style built from full-bleed sunlit photography, oversized cream condensed block typography, diagonal subject crops, compact microcopy clusters, and vivid blue-sky color fields.\",\n\"environment_variables\": {\n\"SUBJECT\": \"main subject\",\n\"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"main action\",\n\"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"object, product, or prop\",\n\"LOCATION\": \"environment or setting\",\n\"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"secondary scene details\",\n\"MAIN_TEXT\": \"main headline or graphic text\",\n\"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"small repeated supporting text\",\n\"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"separator or decorative symbol\",\n\"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"styling direction\",\n\"STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS\": \"observable style traits that must remain visible\",\n\"SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID\": \"literal source content that generated samples must not recreate\",\n\"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"9:16 or 16:9\"\n},","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28573_out.png"]},{"i":4710,"text":"Create a high-energy, explosive music festival promotional poster with the big Chinese text \"来参加我们的音乐节吧！\" prominently displayed at the top in large, bold, graffiti-style font with neon glow effect. Below it in smaller English text: \"JOIN OUR MUSIC FESTIVAL!\" \n\nThe scene is set on Miami Beach at night during a massive summer music festival. Epic cinematic vertical composition. Central focal point is a stunning female character (Mai Shiranui style) wearing a stylish red and white cropped kunoichi-inspired festival outfit with high slits and open front design, showing midriff and legs tastefully. She has long flowing brown hair with red ribbon, beautiful seductive face with confident smile, looking at the viewer. Her skin has premium hybrid texture between high-end 3D render and real human photography — visible pores, subtle peach fuzz, light glistening micro-sweat on collarbones, midriff and thighs, velvety satin sheen with realistic subsurface scattering under neon lights. She holds a beer bottle in one hand and her red fan in the other, standing in a powerful yet playful pose.\n\nSurrounding her are dynamic iconic fighting game and anime characters in festival party mood. Massive outdoor concert stage with giant LED screens, lasers, pyrotechnics and cheering crowd in the background. Dramatic night lighting with vibrant pink, cyan and purple neon, strong rim lighting, volumetric god rays and cinematic lens flares.\n\nUltra-detailed hybrid 3D rendering in Unreal Engine 5 quality, photorealistic skin details with micro-sweat on the central female character, extremely high detail, sharp focus, cinematic color grading, glossy magazine quality. High-energy, wild, sexy and celebratory party atmosphere. Include event details text on the sides, bottom logo area, and VIP box. Vertical poster layout, powerful and inviting festival vibe.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28486_out.png"]},{"i":4711,"text":"Create a near-square high-impact promotional poster collage inspired by an action video game cover, featuring multiple adult female pop-idol figures arranged inside thick black angular comic-panel borders. Use a saturated bright yellow studio background across the entire design, with a large central white block-letter parody game logo and smaller rating-label style graphic elements near the bottom corners.\n\nThe subjects should look like a tactical K-pop girl group concept: slim adult performers with confident, serious expressions, intense glossy eyes, slightly parted or relaxed lips, and strong camera-aware attitude. Preserve varied facial angles and expressions rather than making them identical. Use K-pop editorial makeup: smoky elongated eyeliner, cat-eye shape, shimmer on the eyelids, dramatic lashes, softly contoured cheeks, luminous clean base, and nude-pink lips.\n\nStyle the hair with strong idol-fashion variation: messy wet-textured black waves, long pink-magenta waves under a cap, platinum blonde braids, dark tousled hair, and face-framing strands. Hair should have deliberate flyaways, gloss, volume, and visible studio-light highlights.\n\nWardrobe should mix military streetwear and stage styling: olive green and black cropped tops, camouflage jackets, sleeveless tanks, tactical vests, straps, buckles, belts, cargo pants, fingerless gloves, hoop earrings, chains, rings, and caps. Several outfits should reveal skin in a fashion-stage way: faces, necks, collarbones, shoulders, upper arms, midriffs, waist, small hip-adjacent areas above low-rise pants, and one thigh area through sheer black tights. Skin should look fair to light with warm yellow bounce, smooth and satin-like as if lightly powdered under hot studio lamps, with bright highlights on cheekbones, collarbones, shoulders, and exposed midriff.\n\nUse mixed framing: close-up portraits, half-body shots, cropped torso poses, one central standing figure, a crouched side pose, raised arms, hands near the face or cap, slight torso twists, and aggressive off-center crops. The composition should feel loud, asymmetrical, and poster-like, not like a clean studio portrait.\n\nPhotograph it as if shot with hard frontal studio flash and strong fill light, then composited into a glossy magazine-style fan poster. Keep deep focus, sharp faces, saturated color, hard graphic borders, slight compression texture, and a pasted-game-cover quality. The mood should feel bold, defiant, urban, playful, and fashionably dangerous, as if the characters had already stepped out of a chaotic city mission and are frozen on the cover before the next scene begins.\n\nAvoid a single-subject portrait, plain background, pastel colors, natural outdoor lighting, overly smooth plastic AI skin, childlike faces, oversexualized posing, missing black panel borders, missing central typography, washed-out yellow, blurry text, deformed hands, extra limbs, and generic military cosplay.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28454_out.png"]},{"i":4712,"text":"skin appears fine and smooth while retaining realistic street-photo texture, with natural shadows and slight tonal variation on the shoulders, arms, and abdomen; it should feel warm, soft, smooth, and human rather than heavily airbrushed","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/28444_out.png"]},{"i":4713,"text":"[BRAND NAME]\n\nAct as a Zine Art Director recreating the aesthetic of a 1990s street culture magazine cover — the entire composition is built on a school notebook page covered in handwritten doodles, with a halftone photograph pasted on top and a large aggressive brand logo painted over everything. This looks exactly like a real teenager decorated their school notebook. References: Thrasher Magazine 1992, DIY zine culture, school notebook graffiti, 90s street culture and music magazine covers.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 0: BRAND INTELLIGENCE — AUTONOMOUS EXTRACTION\n\nHERO SUBJECT DETERMINATION — UNIVERSAL RULE: before choosing any visual element identify [BRAND NAME]'s category and apply this logic autonomously. Food and beverage brands (McDonald's, Coca-Cola, Red Bull, Starbucks) — hero subject is the iconic product: burger, bottle, can, cup, no person unless brand has a specific mascot. Automotive brands (Ferrari, BMW, Toyota, Porsche) — hero subject is the most iconic car model in a dynamic moment: mid-corner, full speed, dramatic angle. Technology brands (Apple, Sony, Canon) — hero subject is the hero device or product in use. Fashion and streetwear brands (Supreme, Nike, Adidas, Vans) — hero subject is a person wearing the product or the iconic product itself. Music and entertainment brands — hero subject is a cultural figure associated with the brand. Beauty and cosmetics brands — hero subject is the hero product. Sports brands — hero subject is an athlete in action or the hero product. Never default to a human figure — always determine the most culturally resonant subject for [BRAND NAME]'s specific category first. The chosen subject appears in the central halftone photograph.\n\nBRAND NAME TYPOGRAPHY: identify [BRAND NAME]'s name and exact canonical logo geometry — used in PHASE 4.\n\nBRAND LANGUAGE: identify real phrases, slogans, product names, cultural references, and community language specific to [BRAND NAME]'s world. For a car brand: model names, racing heritage, engineering terms, famous circuits. For a food brand: menu items, taglines, ingredients, locations. For a fashion brand: collection names, cultural figures, city references. Never use generic streetwear language unless the brand is genuinely streetwear.\n\nISSUE INFORMATION: identify real [BRAND NAME] dates, founding year, events, prices, or catalog information — appears as small printed text in the lower right corner.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 1: NOTEBOOK BACKGROUND — CRITICAL FOUNDATION\n\nThe entire background is a real school notebook page — college-ruled lined paper. Horizontal blue lines running across the full width, evenly spaced approximately 8 to 9mm apart. A red vertical margin line approximately 30 to 35mm from the left edge. Paper color: warm white to very slightly cream — #F8F6F0 to #F5F2EA. Slight paper texture — real grain, not perfectly flat. Spiral binding visible along the right edge — metal coil with evenly spaced loops, punched holes visible. The binding casts a very subtle shadow on the paper.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 2: HANDWRITTEN DOODLE LAYER — COVERS ENTIRE BACKGROUND\n\nThe notebook page is completely covered in handwritten text, doodles, and marks — exactly like a real teenager's decorated notebook. Multiple writing styles suggesting different pens and different hands.\n\nWriting tools present: blue ballpoint pen — majority of text. Black ballpoint or felt tip — bolder statements. Red pen or marker — occasional emphasis. Pencil — faint lighter marks.\n\nContent — all real [BRAND NAME]-related language from the brand's specific world: product names, model names, slogans, taglines, names of people or places associated with the brand, dates, numbers, cultural references authentic only to [BRAND NAME]. Random doodles: stars, arrows, symbols, phone numbers, crossed out words, underlines, circles. Text fills every available space — no large empty zones. Some text runs along the notebook lines, some cuts diagonally, some written vertically in margins. Authentic pen-on-paper quality with natural pressure variation and ink bleed.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 3: HALFTONE PHOTOGRAPH\n\nA black and white photograph of the hero subject determined in PHASE 0 — person, vehicle, product, or object — treated with a coarse halftone screen exactly like a 1990s magazine photograph on newsprint. If the subject is a vehicle: shown in a dramatic dynamic moment — mid-corner, at speed, from a low dramatic angle. If the subject is a product: shown in its natural environment in active use. If the subject is a person: shown in dynamic action authentic to their discipline. Halftone properties: visible dot screen, coarse enough to be clearly seen, consistent with 1990s magazine printing. High contrast — shadows near-black, highlights near-white. The photograph is large — central 60% of composition height, 70% of width. Sits on top of the handwritten doodle layer. Some handwritten text continues over the photograph edges. No border — blends into notebook background at edges.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 4: BRAND LOGO — DOMINANT TITLE — CRITICAL\n\n[BRAND NAME]'s canonical trademark-accurate logo rendered in the upper zone — spanning approximately 85 to 90% of total width. CRITICAL — LOGO FIDELITY: the logo must reproduce the EXACT OFFICIAL letterform geometry of [BRAND NAME] — not a generic brush font, not an approximation, not a similar-looking typeface. The exact trademarked shapes, proportions, curves, and letter construction of the real [BRAND NAME] logo as it appears in official brand materials. Fidelity test: a brand lawyer must look at this logo and immediately confirm it is the correct [BRAND NAME] mark — not a lookalike. Examples of what this means: Starbucks uses its specific siren-influenced custom lettering — reproduce those exact letterforms. Toyota uses its specific bold geometric caps — reproduce those exact proportions. Vans uses its specific hand-drawn italic script — reproduce that exact character. Nike uses its specific clean sans — reproduce that exactly.\n\nHand-painted treatment applied ON TOP of correct geometry: once the correct logo geometry is established, apply a thick marker or wide brush paint treatment over it — brush strokes follow the existing letterform shapes, adding paint texture, slight edge roughness, ink spread at stroke endings, and hand-applied quality. The result: the real canonical logo geometry rendered as if painted by hand with a wide marker or brush — recognizably correct in shape and proportion but with authentic hand-painted texture and energy. Color: [BRAND NAME]'s most iconic primary brand color. The logo is the uppermost layer — on top of both notebook background and photograph.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 5: SECONDARY TYPOGRAPHY\n\nSubject identifier: the name of the person, car model, product name, or hero subject written large in the lower zone in thick marker lettering — dark color, navy or black. Two lines if long.\n\nAdditional hand-lettered phrases: 2 to 3 larger handwritten phrases in the middle zones — real [BRAND NAME] phrases or subject descriptors authentic to the brand's world.\n\nIssue information: lower right corner — small printed text block showing founding year, date, price, event, or catalog information from [BRAND NAME]'s real history. Small, neat, printed not handwritten.\n\nTop strip: a single line of small printed text across the top above the logo — names, references, or cultural touchpoints associated specifically with [BRAND NAME]'s world, separated by dots or bullets. Authentic to the brand's documented universe only.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 6: COMPOSITION\n\nAspect ratio: 3:4 portrait — magazine cover format. Large logo top, photograph center, subject name bottom, small info lower right. Handwritten doodle layer fills every zone. Spiral binding on right edge confirms notebook format. Overall impression: a real teenager's school notebook that also happens to be a brand campaign.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 7: TECH SPECS\n\nBackground: real ruled notebook paper with visible line texture and spiral binding. Handwriting layer: authentic pen-on-paper quality — multiple writing tools, natural pressure variation, ink bleed at line intersections. Photograph: coarse halftone black and white — visible dot screen, high contrast, 1990s magazine print quality. Subject in photograph determined entirely by [BRAND NAME]'s category — never defaulting to a human figure unless the brand's world genuinely centers on a person. Brand logo: the canonical trademark-accurate logo geometry with hand-painted marker texture applied on top — correct shapes, painted finish. Overall grain: slight scan grain across the entire image — as if physically scanned. Color palette: notebook paper white, blue ruled lines, red margin line, [BRAND NAME]'s brand color for the logo, dark navy/black for handwriting. Output feel: this looks like a real magazine cover from 1992 — authentic, handmade, analog.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/21205_out.png"]},{"i":4714,"text":"POV travel photography of a person sitting at an airport and inside an airplane, casual outfit with jeans and sneakers, small crossbody bag on lap, holding a drink can, warm golden sunlight streaming through windows. Scene 1: airport waiting area with luggage (suitcase and backpack), cinematic composition, cozy travel vibe. Scene 2: airplane seat view looking down at legs and tray area, window light casting soft shadows. Add playful hand-drawn doodles and annotations around objects (bags, drink, shoes, seat) including arrows, hearts, stars, clouds, and handwritten notes like “window seat dreams”, “ready for takeoff”, “good vibes only”, “travel • chill • repeat”. White and yellow sketch-style overlays, scrapbook aesthetic, soft warm color grading, shallow depth of field, ultra-realistic, Instagram story style, cinematic lifestyle photography, 4K","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/21052_out.png"]},{"i":4715,"text":"Transform my photo into a high-end cinematic streetwear editorial poster. Keep my face, body, pose, outfit, and original background recognizable, but enhance everything into a luxury fashion campaign aesthetic. Add 4 realistic duplicate versions of me across the frame placed naturally like motion-captured walk sequences. Keep the main/front version largest, sharpest, and most detailed, while side clones are slightly faded or motion blurred. Use dramatic overhead lighting with a subtle glow, deep shadows, long floor shadows, cool-toned cinematic color grading, strong contrast, glossy highlights, and soft film grain. Make the outfit textures crisp and premium. Add bold oversized magazine-style typography in the top corner with one powerful word ''NATION'' . Include smaller minimal text such as collection year, slogan, barcode, or campaign details.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/21050_out.png"]},{"i":4716,"text":"Universal Dodge Viper Style Vehicle Poster Prompt(Use your own vehicle photo as the image reference. Works for cars, bikes, trucks, SUVs, hypercars, superbikes, and any vehicle.)PROMPTUse my uploaded vehicle photo as the primary reference. Preserve the exact vehicle design, paint color, body shape, wheels, modifications, decals, proportions, and perspective from the reference image.Create a premium luxury automotive advertising poster in the style of a high-end performance vehicle magazine cover. The vehicle is positioned front and center as the hero subject, occupying approximately 75% of the frame. Dramatic low-angle wide-lens automotive photography, aggressive stance, showroom-quality reflections, ultra-detailed bodywork.Massive bold condensed typography displaying \"[FARRARI]\" behind the vehicle, partially hidden by the subject to create depth and a premium editorial look. Small manufacturer logo placed above the title. Dark industrial warehouse environment with huge illuminated windows, cinematic atmosphere, volumetric lighting, subtle fog, reflective polished floor, realistic reflections and shadows.Professional studio lighting with strong key light, bright side illumination, dramatic rim lighting, glossy highlights across the body panels, premium reflections on paint, glass, chrome, carbon fiber, and metal surfaces. Ultra-realistic materials and textures.Include luxury magazine-style graphic design elements: specification text section, technical information block, barcode element, premium layout grid, small showcase thumbnails of the vehicle at the bottom, layered shadows, depth effects, subtle geometric overlays, premium automotive branding aesthetic.Color grading based on the vehicle's original paint color, enhanced with luxury black, charcoal, graphite, and silver tones. Deep blacks, rich contrast, cinematic highlights, HDR lighting, premium commercial advertising look, automotive photography masterpiece.Hyper-realistic, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, award-winning automotive poster, luxury vehicle advertisement, professional editorial design, 8K resolution, HDR, ray tracing, global illumination, sharp focus, realistic reflections, premium composition, magazine-quality artwork.Editable Variables[FARRARI] = Vehicle model nameColor Theme = Match vehicle color automaticallyBackground = Warehouse / Garage / Race Track / Showroom / TunnelLogo = Brand logo above titlePoster Ratio = 4:5, 9:16, 1:1, or A4Negative Promptlow quality, blurry, pixelated, bad perspective, distorted vehicle, warped body panels, deformed wheels, extra wheels, duplicated vehicle, floating vehicle, unrealistic reflections, incorrect shadows, bad lighting, overexposed, underexposed, low detail, low resolution, text artifacts, misspelled typography, stretched logo, cropped vehicle, out of frame, cartoon, anime, illustration, painting, sketch, CGI look, plastic materials, fake reflections, poor composition, watermark, signature, frame cuts, duplicate parts, AI artifacts, messy background, clutter, noise, grain, motion blur, soft focus, oversaturated colors, washed-out colors, unrealistic proportions, broken geometry, low-quality poster design, amateur graphic design, distorted headlights, distorted rims, unrealistic carbon fiber, cheap advertisement style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/21024_out.png"]},{"i":4717,"text":"高端日系时装杂志封面感插画，主体为[韩国女孩]，极简现代时装数字插画风，精致赛璐璐上色，干净锐利的大色块塑形，几乎无线稿，边缘优雅清晰。画面保持蓝白骨架配色，同时加入少量珊瑚红、雾紫、浅黄、灰粉、鼠尾草绿、银灰等辅助色，整体仍然简约、高级、统一，不花哨。背景干净，可为钴蓝、皇家蓝、雾蓝等纯净大色块，并保留大面积负空间。强烈阳光从左上方照射，白色区域明亮接近过曝，阴影使用冷蓝、灰蓝、蓝紫色硬边块面表现。主体轮廓修长，姿态安静冷淡，细节简化但造型准确，整体清透、冷艳、时尚，像高级杂志封面海报。无文字，无水印，无复杂背景，无写实摄影，无 3D，无厚涂，无低幼卡通，无杂乱装饰。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20697_out.png"]},{"i":4718,"text":"実在SNS写真、成人ニュ ー ハ ー フ 美女、深夜のコンビニ帰りセルフィー、片手にレジ袋、肩掛けトートバッグ、ベージュの薄手ニット、ダークデニム、少し疲れた表情、ナチュラルメイク、黒髪ロング、コンビニの蛍光灯と街灯の混合光、スマホ広角セルフィー、自然なHDR、軽い夜間ノイズ、肌の自然なツヤ、生活感のある駐車場、友人に送るために何となく撮った一枚、少し傾いた構図、SNS圧縮感、日常スナップ、非広告写真\n\nネガティブ:\nスタジオ撮影、グラビア、過度なレタッチ、AI肌、完璧な構図、ファッション広告、過剰な美肌補正","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20688_out.png"]},{"i":4719,"text":"Create a AAA-quality Unreal Engine 5 outfit selection screen for 【ganyu from genshin impaxct】\n\nThe visual style should be a high-quality realistic 3D game interface, making the character look like a fully playable in-game character. She should feature Unreal Engine 5-level detailed modeling, realistic skin texture, cinematic lighting, refined fabric materials, and a premium game UI design.\n\nAt the center of the page is the outfit selection interface, showcasing 4 completely different 【lingire outfits but make them ave difrent themed ones eg chinse, battle suit sexy, sucubus and cat girl】 for players to choose from.\nEach outfit should be paired with a different pose that highlights its unique strengths and visual appeal.\n\nThe page layout should be customized to match the character’s identity and personality, keeping the design rich and visually impressive while still clear and easy to read.\nShe should look like a realistic 3D game character, and the interface should include a prominent title area styled like a character name header.\nThe composition should be clean and well-structured, with a clear separation between the character and the UI elements, creating the feel of an authentic 3D game screenshot.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20662_out.png"]}];